    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Likobola lie Baisiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Babaandu ba Isiraeli bali nga kamakheese kayiimwa ne chitalang'i. Omwami owa Ashuru niye owanyoa abebwaakala, ne ekhumaliilikha omwami Nebukadinesa owa Babiloni abafunaake kamakuumba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele we Baisiraeli aloma ali, “Lola ese ndikho ndeera siiukuumo khu mwami owa Babiloni ne mu sibala siewe bulayi bwene nga ne naukuuma omwami owa Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khakobosie Baisiraeli mu sibala siabwe, bakhalie biakhulia bimiichwa khu sikulu sia Karimeli ne mu lukoongo lwa Basiani, mala bakhalie biakhulia bioosi bimiichwa mu bibala bia Efuraimu ne mu Kileati bekure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne siise esio ne sikhoole, bubwoni se buliba mu Isiraeli namwe bumayaanu mu Yuda tawe. Kaliba kario sikila ese ndibeela abo nibo naramia. Ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nalomile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bukhalaki bwa Wele khu Babiloni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
