          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, aloma ali, “Babaandu ba Isiraeli alala ne babaandu ba Yuda boosi balikho bapisibwa sibi. Abo ba babaamba babaliindile siimbi mbo se banyala belukha tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali oyo olabasikula ali ne kamaani, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Omwene alemeelela buli siindu mala areere kumuleembe khu sibala ne kakhali khu Babiloni ndareera butinyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.34"
            ]
          }
        }
